    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i>In <i>Chante: Fortress of Spores,</i> you play as  an adventurous little fungus trying to save her circle of spores. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Chante on their Adventure! Explore, solve puzzles, defend, and expand your Circle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/5693f40e0ec52b69718b5ee50cbcac05.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure takes place beneath the surface. Use your wits to solve various puzzles. Secrets may lie hidden just beyond the corner. Can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, beware of lurking enemies and wild mushrooms as they are territorial and will attack on sight!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/1a93efbdc8adf340512a88418226ed3f.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and utilize them to craft allies that can assist in defending your safe zone!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/94dd7f81c45334372d60ce4a1a6db8d1.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ants are declaring war! Protect your territory from their onslaught with your reliable shovel and the aid of your strategically placed Mushroom allies!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/a25171d8da9bc28a95879c071dc61c8e.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain strength by defeating powerful enemies! Evolve your mushroom  into mighty allies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After the game's storyline is complete, you can continue to gather all the undiscovered collectibles, find all the mushroom types, and evolve as much as your heart desires!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/275e146dddfd8c41a62a133d278ce1f2.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i>In <i>Chante: Fortress of Spores,</i> you play as  an adventurous little fungus trying to save her circle of spores. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Chante on their Adventure! Explore, solve puzzles, defend, and expand your Circle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/5693f40e0ec52b69718b5ee50cbcac05.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure takes place beneath the surface. Use your wits to solve various puzzles. Secrets may lie hidden just beyond the corner. Can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, beware of lurking enemies and wild mushrooms as they are territorial and will attack on sight!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/1a93efbdc8adf340512a88418226ed3f.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and utilize them to craft allies that can assist in defending your safe zone!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/94dd7f81c45334372d60ce4a1a6db8d1.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ants are declaring war! Protect your territory from their onslaught with your reliable shovel and the aid of your strategically placed Mushroom allies!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/a25171d8da9bc28a95879c071dc61c8e.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain strength by defeating powerful enemies! Evolve your mushroom  into mighty allies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After the game's storyline is complete, you can continue to gather all the undiscovered collectibles, find all the mushroom types, and evolve as much as your heart desires!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190570/extras/275e146dddfd8c41a62a133d278ce1f2.avif?t=1746016442\" data-has-big width=800 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In this third-person, tower defense/ puzzle game, you play as the adventurous little fungus, Chante! Explore, gather, and craft to uncover resources that will fortify your defenses, while\u00a0surviving waves of enemy attacks. Join us in discovering the oddities of Chante: Fortress of Spores.",
